{"name": "Fugue Shot: Minigame Roguelike", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"162\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/2f8f94389c4aa5cc4e17d3ca49e32688.poster.avif?t=1787245291\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/2f8f94389c4aa5cc4e17d3ca49e32688.webm?t=1787245291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run in <strong>Fugue Shot</strong> takes place in a shifting dreamscape filled with dangerous  encounters known as the Omens, ranging from strategic puzzles to fast-paced action arenas. Face these challenges and collect Memories that alter properties across all Omens, reshaping the dream and the way you play. Can you overcome the unstable terrain of this liminal world, or will it consume you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/f67831e9bad2152f95f91a694cc74662.poster.avif?t=1787245291\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/f67831e9bad2152f95f91a694cc74662.webm?t=1787245291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/f67831e9bad2152f95f91a694cc74662.mp4?t=1787245291\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiple Playstyles, One Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face any of <strong>10\u00a0different Omens</strong>, <strong>each offering a</strong> <strong>distinct arcade-inspired minigame experience</strong>. Pick between Omens to challenge, and strategize accordingly across intense combat, precision-based reaction tests, physics-driven puzzles, and more - all within one run. As you progress, Omens evolve, growing in complexity and intensity as they drag you deeper into the dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/768c1c1821935445b885cddc6f99c5cf.poster.avif?t=1787245291\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/768c1c1821935445b885cddc6f99c5cf.webm?t=1787245291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/768c1c1821935445b885cddc6f99c5cf.mp4?t=1787245291\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Power Up Your Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover <strong>over 150 unique Memories</strong> that transform how you approach each Omen, adapting your playstyle and bending the dream. Choose upgrades that enhance your abilities, unleash powerful synergies, and create game-breaking builds. Fill out entries in your Dream Journal to chart the dreamscape for future runs, and chip away at <strong>over 80 permanent unlocks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/158a1d3cbe28e2942f4444c13c41729d.poster.avif?t=1787245291\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/158a1d3cbe28e2942f4444c13c41729d.webm?t=1787245291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/158a1d3cbe28e2942f4444c13c41729d.mp4?t=1787245291\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An Eerily Beautiful World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stunning and stylish pixel art compliments a hypnotic and meditative soundtrack to create a surreal, dreamy atmosphere. The world of <strong>Fugue Shot</strong> is a vivid dream designed  to get lost in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/4c1c7a6b92665d8518e54690dfcd7fcd.poster.avif?t=1787245291\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/4c1c7a6b92665d8518e54690dfcd7fcd.webm?t=1787245291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/4c1c7a6b92665d8518e54690dfcd7fcd.mp4?t=1787245291\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "10 games, 1 roguelike. Face a gauntlet of arcade-inspired minigames and collect upgrades that affect all encounters. Can you defeat the Omens and find your way out of this ever-shifting dream?", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/80988198cb5830a8f90d24c6f7d26bf404d1ec84/header.jpg?t=1787245291", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Arcade", "Roguelike", "Strategy", "Pixel Graphics", "Action Roguelike", "Minigames"], "developers": "Rare Dialect", "publishers": "Rare Dialect", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3538440", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "20 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/RnN04r6RCJs", "first_seen": 1787184000.0}